    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-cross" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> DESIGN MINDED. EVIDENCE LED.</p><h1 id="hero-title">Good ideas.<br />Made <em>tangible.</em></h1><p class="hero-intro">I’m Samson Onuh, the builder behind Krespo Labs. This is a space for thoughtful websites, product explorations, and the proof behind the work.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#work">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#approach">How I approach a build <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-label">AN IDEA, TAKING SHAPE.</div><div class="orb orb-one"></div><div class="orb orb-two"></div><div class="orb orb-three"></div><div class="orbit-line"></div><div class="art-bottom"><span>FORM + FUNCTION</span><span>KL — 01</span></div><span class="art-spark">✳</span></div>
