    <article class="featured-project">
      <a class="garden-preview" href="/demos/fern-and-field/"><div class="preview-top"><span class="preview-logo">fern <i>&</i> field<span>GARDEN CARE · FICTIONAL DEMO</span></span><span class="preview-menu">A little care goes a long way. ↗</span></div><div class="preview-copy"><span class="preview-kicker">A CONCEPT ROOTED IN CARE</span><p>A greener<br /><i>everyday.</i></p><span class="preview-cta">Explore the garden ↗</span></div><div class="garden-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="garden-sun"></div><div class="garden-arch"></div><div class="leaf leaf-one"></div><div class="leaf leaf-two"></div><div class="leaf leaf-three"></div><div class="garden-stem"></div><div class="garden-ground"></div></div><span class="preview-tag">FICTIONAL BUSINESS / DESIGN DEMO</span></a>
      <div class="project-detail"><div><div class="project-type"><span class="project-number">01</span><span>FEATURED CASE / LOCAL SERVICE</span></div><h3>Fern &amp; Field</h3><p>A garden-care concept that makes a simple service feel considered. A complete static experience, from service discovery to a clearly disabled enquiry state.</p><div class="tags"><span>Astro</span><span>Original CSS & SVG</span><span>Responsive</span></div></div><div class="project-links"><a class="button" href="/work/fern-and-field/">Read the case <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/demos/fern-and-field/">Explore fictional demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>No real business. No bookings or data collection.</p></div></div>
    </article>
    <div class="explorations-heading"><h3>Also on the workbench</h3><span>SOURCE LINKS, NOT PRODUCTION CLAIMS</span></div>
    <div class="project-grid"><article class="source-card"><div class="source-card-top"><span>02 / WEB INTERFACE</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="mini-art lovinex-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="outline-heart">♡</span><span class="mini-label">lovinex / interface exploration</span></div><h3>Lovinex Web</h3><p>A dating-web interface in development. Deployment and current status are unverified; no live-service or completed-feature claims are made here.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Krespolabs/Lovinex">View source repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="status-tag">CURRENT STATUS UNVERIFIED</span></article><article class="source-card"><div class="source-card-top"><span>03 / PRODUCT EXPLORATION</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="mini-art hub-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hub-symbol">✳</div><span class="mini-label">krespoai hub / prototype interface</span></div><h3>KrespoAI Hub</h3><p>A prototype interface for an AI tools hub. Working integrations are unverified. The source link is context, not evidence of operational services.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Krespolabs/Krespoai-hub">View source repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="status-tag">PROTOTYPE INTERFACE</span></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="approach-section" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE APPROACH</p><h2 id="approach-title">Less noise.<br />More purpose.</h2></div><p>A useful website should be easy to understand, comfortable to use, and honest about what it can do.</p></div><div class="approach-grid"><article><span>01 — CLARITY</span><h3>Start with the useful.</h3><p>Make the next step obvious. Give the content room to breathe and keep the structure simple.</p></article><article><span>02 — CRAFT</span><h3>Make it feel considered.</h3><p>Bring typography, colour, and responsive layouts together without unnecessary complexity.</p></article><article><span>03 — EVIDENCE</span><h3>Show what exists.</h3><p>Separate working demos from prototypes. Link the source and describe limitations in plain language.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="about-section wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title"><p class="eyebrow">03 / BEHIND THE WORK</p><div class="about-body"><h2 id="about-title">A builder’s curiosity.<br /><em>A thoughtful finish.</em></h2><div><p>I’m Samson, also known as Krespo. Krespo Labs is where I explore how ideas become useful digital experiences.</p><p>This portfolio starts small: one original fictional service-business demo, transparent project notes, and room for future evidence. No invented outcomes or client results.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Krespolabs">Explore Krespo Labs on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Shell>
